        "text": "1134. 求下列各式的值：\n1) $\\left(\\frac{1}{14}-\\frac{2}{7}\\right):(-3)-6\\frac{1}{13}:\\left(-6\\frac{1}{13}\\right)$；\n2) $\\left(7-8\\frac{4}{5}\\right)\\cdot2\\frac{7}{9}-15:\\left(\\frac{1}{8}-\\frac{3}{4}\\right)$."
      }
